{"ID":"20240220132618-1dtthdj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132618-1dtthdj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132618-1dtthdj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164355-oz08fxe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164333-yqy6lt0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:531,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164357-wtruj6r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【瓜蒂散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312164357"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312164355-oz08fxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-oz08fxe","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百八十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-i7oxfrr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-i7oxfrr","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：病如「桂枝证」,头不痛,项不强,寸脉微浮,胸中痞鞕,气上冲咽喉,不得息者,此为胸有寒也,当吐之,宜「瓜蒂散」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-76pa344","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-76pa344","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病像桂枝汤症，但是他头没有痛。项不强,寸脉微浮,胸中痞鞕,胃的地方非常的硬，气上冲咽喉,上下气不通，一个东西梗到，不得息者,此为胸有寒也,"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个‘寒’应该把它当作‘实’"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。比如吞到骨头、铜币梗到，当吐之,就是有异物梗到里面的时候，中医是采用吐法，宜「瓜蒂散」。越甜的瓜，瓜蒂越苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-tcrtp22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-tcrtp22","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒂散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-dm73y7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-dm73y7n","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒂一分熬黄。赤小豆一分。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-m1qwi7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-m1qwi7c","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味，各别捣筛，为散已，合治之，取一钱匕，以香豉一合，用热汤七合，煮作稀糜,去滓，取汁，合散顿服之。不吐者少少加,得快者吐乃止，诸亡血虚家，不可与瓜蒂散。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-mbq6iww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-mbq6iww","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂熬黄，就是烤一下变黄，不要放水里面去熬，是烤一下变黄。配合赤小豆等量。这两个和在一起吃下，当场就吐掉了。我们确定他有东西梗到的时候使用。表面上就是吃了这个瓜蒂散就吐，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景只有这个方子在吐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-03bzdvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-03bzdvy","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上，治很多病，根本没有用到吐剂，病人是吐了而解掉，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吐是一种解病除的方式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-qompf68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-qompf68","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾经有一个病人打电话跟我说有肾结石。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾结石，中医的判断方法可以在太溪穴到复溜穴这一段，这一段有压痛点，就是有结石结到，一般的处方有猪苓汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，西医的方法呢就是病人验尿，试纸咖啡色就代表有结石，他过来我给他扎针，扎针的时候，痛已经去掉，病人能感觉到结石在移动，然后开汤药给他，猪苓汤，第二天他又打电话来说他好了，我说他怎么知道自己好了，他说试纸变成蓝色正常了，痛也没有了，小便看到有石头排出来。可是呢，他说头天晚上吃完药很不好过。他吃完药吐，一吐完小便就跟着下来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-tdoai2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-tdoai2s","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你开猪苓汤的时候，想的他根本就不是吐剂。吐解有两种，一种是真正是服药去吐它。还有一种是因为他是肾结石，上面有痰梗到，所以尿才会在肾里面一直累积起来，排不出去，尿垢慢慢累积起来变成结石。要是吃一些钙片，维他命C，结石出现的更快。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164355-5sr64kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164355-5sr64kq","updated":"20240312164355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们当地有牙医，吃最新的维他命C，才吃两个礼拜，马上就肾结石。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164357-wtruj6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164357-wtruj6r"}},{"ID":"20240312164333-222pl9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164333-222pl9p","updated":"20240312164333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百七十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164333-6sxyit6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164333-6sxyit6","updated":"20240312164333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：病人手足厥冷，脉乍紧者，邪结在胸中，心下满而烦，饥不能食者，病在胸中，当须吐之，宜用「瓜蒂散」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164333-jy74ic7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164333-jy74ic7","updated":"20240312164333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“脉乍紧者，邪结在胸中，”脉有时候紧，有时候不紧，邪在胸中，梗在这边，东西吃不下，所以病人告诉你胸腔很痛，东西吞不下去。这个时候要看他是不是东西梗到了，气色很好，声音很大，一定东西梗到了。只要确定有东西梗到，用吐的方式。宜用瓜蒂散。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164333-lars897","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164333-lars897","updated":"20240312164333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想其他办法让他吐也可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164333-zfa6bo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164333-zfa6bo6","updated":"20240312164333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如手按住内关，一直提示自己要吐的欲望，一会就吐出来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164333-yqy6lt0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164333-yqy6lt0","updated":"20240312164333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如用手扣。"}]}]}